---
description: RLS and migration workflow for Supabase tenant tables
globs: supabase/migrations/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Supabase migrations

Do not reintroduce `using (true)` policies on tenant tables.

- Every tenant table: RLS on, policies scoped by
  `workspace_id in (select workspace_id from public.profiles where id = auth.uid())`
  (or documented join).
- Secrets: encrypt via `lib/workspace-secrets.ts`; do not SELECT plaintext keys for `authenticated`.
- New file: `supabase/migrations/YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description.sql` — never edit already-applied migrations.
- Verify locally: `npx supabase db reset`.
